      "writtenOn": "2017-12-13T17:45:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why call this on HOOK_INIT? Won\u0027t it skew your measurements slightly since HOOK_INIT to first HOOK_TICK interval may not be close to HOOK_TICK_INTERVAL?",
